{"id": "t3-p-001", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "除了医生的名字，别的全部打码", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"], "note": "Only some PERSON values kept: broadest covering hide plus unsupported."}
{"id": "t3-p-002", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "这是我妈的出院小结，要发给保险公司理赔用。里面所有个人信息都遮掉，就留主治医生的名字，他们要核对。", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "verticals": ["healthcare"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "vertical", "long"], "note": "Discharge summary is a medical record; the insurer is the recipient, not the document kind."}
{"id": "t3-p-003", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "全遮了吧 只留法官名字就行", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "colloquial"]}
{"id": "t3-p-004", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "银行卡号留后四位，其余信息全部隐藏", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"], "note": "Partial masking is unsupported; the card is covered by the hide-all."}
{"id": "t3-p-005", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "这份上海的租房合同，除了房东的名字和日期，其他都帮我隐藏掉", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide", "DATE": "keep", "BIRTH_DATE": "keep"}, "regions": ["cn"], "verticals": ["legal"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "region", "vertical", "dates"], "note": "Dates in general are a whole-type keep; the landlord's name is only part of PERSON."}
{"id": "t3-p-006", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "公司的地址可以留着，剩下的通通遮住", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-007", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "把病人的名字遮掉，医生的名字不用遮", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide", "negation"]}
{"id": "t3-p-008", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "只隐藏手机号，座机号码保留", "expect": {"types": {"PHONE": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["only", "unsupported", "single_hide"], "note": "The only stays within PHONE, so no \"*\"."}
{"id": "t3-p-009", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "我在整理一份材料，里面有我和几个同事的名字。我的名字要遮住，同事的名字留着，他们同意公开的。", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide", "long"]}
{"id": "t3-p-010", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "除了人名，其他都遮掉", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide", "PERSON": "keep"}}, "tags": ["except", "single_keep"]}
{"id": "t3-p-011", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "除了李春华这个名字，其他全部隐藏", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "never_hide": ["李春华"]}, "tags": ["except", "never_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-012", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "把房东的名字遮一下", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}}, "tags": ["single_hide"], "note": "Qualifier alone, no other value of the type excluded."}
{"id": "t3-p-013", "lang": "zh", "instruction": "只遮身份证号和电话", "expect": {"types": {"*": "off", "ID": "hide", "PHONE": "hide"}}, "tags": ["only", "type_mapping"]}
{"id": "t3-p-014", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Redact everything apart from the names of the treating physicians, please.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-015", "lang": "en", "instruction": "I'm a paralegal in Texas. This is a court order from a custody case; black out everything except the judge's name and the court's address.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "regions": ["us"], "verticals": ["legal"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "region", "vertical", "long"]}
{"id": "t3-p-016", "lang": "en", "instruction": "pls hide evrything but my lawyers name, he needs to be visible lol", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "colloquial"]}
{"id": "t3-p-017", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Mask it all except our staff's names and emails - client details have to go.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-018", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Hide everything, but leave first names showing so the reader can follow who's who.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-019", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Redact the tenant's name but leave the landlord's as is.", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-020", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Only the mobile numbers need hiding, not the office landlines.", "expect": {"types": {"PHONE": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["only", "unsupported", "single_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-021", "lang": "en", "instruction": "On this payslip, hide my salary but not the employer contributions.", "expect": {"types": {"AMOUNT": "hide"}, "verticals": ["employment"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide", "vertical", "type_mapping"]}
{"id": "t3-p-022", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Hide everything except people's names.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide", "PERSON": "keep"}}, "tags": ["except", "single_keep"]}
{"id": "t3-p-023", "lang": "en", "instruction": "Redact everything except Dr. Hannah Oyelaran - she signed it and has to stay readable.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "never_hide": ["Dr. Hannah Oyelaran"]}, "tags": ["except", "never_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-024", "lang": "en", "instruction": "hide the patient's name and date of birth", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide", "BIRTH_DATE": "hide"}}, "tags": ["dates"], "note": "Qualifier alone: whole types, no unsupported."}
{"id": "t3-p-025", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "Vous pouvez tout anonymiser sauf les noms des médecins ? C'est un compte rendu d'hospitalisation.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "verticals": ["healthcare"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "vertical"]}
{"id": "t3-p-026", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "masque tout sauf le tel de l'hopital", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "colloquial"]}
{"id": "t3-p-027", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "C'est un bail pour un appart à Lyon. Je veux tout cacher sauf le nom du propriétaire.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "regions": ["fr"], "verticals": ["legal"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "region", "vertical", "long"]}
{"id": "t3-p-028", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "Tout caviarder sauf l'adresse de la société, le reste doit disparaître.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-029", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "Masquez le nom du locataire, mais pas celui du bailleur.", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide", "negation"]}
{"id": "t3-p-030", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "Cache juste les noms de famille, pas les prénoms", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["only", "unsupported", "single_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-031", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "Masquez tout sauf les numéros de téléphone.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide", "PHONE": "keep"}}, "tags": ["except", "single_keep"]}
{"id": "t3-p-032", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "tout masquer sauf Maître Corinne Vasseur", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "never_hide": ["Maître Corinne Vasseur"]}, "tags": ["except", "never_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-033", "lang": "fr", "instruction": "Il faut masquer le nom de l'expert-comptable dans ce mail", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}}, "tags": ["single_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-034", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Es una sentencia: tápalo todo menos los nombres de los jueces", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "verticals": ["legal"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "vertical", "colloquial"]}
{"id": "t3-p-035", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Ocultad todo salvo los teléfonos de nuestros empleados, que son los de contacto de la empresa.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-036", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Contrato de alquiler de un piso en Valencia: ocultad todo excepto el nombre del casero.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "regions": ["es"], "verticals": ["legal"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported", "region", "vertical"]}
{"id": "t3-p-037", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Oculta el DNI del paciente pero no el número de colegiado del médico", "expect": {"types": {"ID": "hide"}, "regions": ["es"], "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide", "type_mapping", "region"], "note": "DNI and a professional licence number are both ID, so this keeps part of one type."}
{"id": "t3-p-038", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Solo quiero tapar los móviles, los fijos que se vean.", "expect": {"types": {"PHONE": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["only", "unsupported", "single_hide", "colloquial"]}
{"id": "t3-p-039", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Oculta todo menos los nombres.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide", "PERSON": "keep"}}, "tags": ["except", "single_keep"]}
{"id": "t3-p-040", "lang": "es", "instruction": "Tapa el nombre del inquilino y su DNI.", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide", "ID": "hide"}, "regions": ["es"]}, "tags": ["type_mapping", "region"]}
{"id": "t3-p-041", "lang": "de", "instruction": "Bitte alles schwärzen außer den Namen unserer Mitarbeiter.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-042", "lang": "de", "instruction": "Den Namen des Patienten schwärzen, den der Ärztin nicht.", "expect": {"types": {"PERSON": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["unsupported", "single_hide", "negation"]}
{"id": "t3-p-043", "lang": "de", "instruction": "Alles schwärzen außer Dr. Jürgen Hallstein.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "never_hide": ["Dr. Jürgen Hallstein"]}, "tags": ["except", "never_hide"]}
{"id": "t3-p-044", "lang": "it", "instruction": "Oscura tutto tranne il nome del mio avvocato, per favore.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide"}, "unsupported": true}, "tags": ["except", "unsupported"]}
{"id": "t3-p-045", "lang": "it", "instruction": "Oscura tutto tranne le date.", "expect": {"types": {"*": "hide", "DATE": "keep", "BIRTH_DATE": "keep"}}, "tags": ["except", "dates"]}
